=== Note on the one "settings" hit above ===
frontend/src/components/import/SelectField.vue:4 is a code COMMENT referencing
components/settings/SettingsSelectField.vue by name for documentation purposes only
("the same gap, hit independently by the settings journey") — not an import statement, not a
runtime dependency. No `import ... from "@/components/settings/..."` exists anywhere under
components/import/, and no `import ... from "@/components/import/..."` exists anywhere under
components/settings/ (the reverse grep above returned exit=1 / no matches).

Verdict: no cross-journey imports beyond the shared components/{atoms,molecules,organisms}
bucket. Journey-owned directories (components/import/, components/settings/) are self-contained;
organisms that are in practice journey-specific (Cardiogram, ListCard for dashboard;
PopupStage/PopupWidget/PwTypeList/ShopMock for popups-widget-editor) are each consumed from
exactly one journey's view(s).
